  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "APR-3051 was approved by Victor Hale, but Tessa Morgan has been the current manager since 10-20, so it doesn't count. I'll request a new approval from Tessa.\n\nI couldn't add you to crm-export yet. APR-3051 was approved by Victor Hale, but Tessa Morgan has been your manager since October 20. Access approvals have to come from your current manager, so APR-3051 doesn't count.\n\nI've sent Tessa a new approval request (APR-4001), and it's waiting on her. It would help to ask her to approve it in the approval system before Friday. Telling us in chat or email won't work, because it has to be recorded there. Once she approves it, the desk can add you right away. I've set ticket T-6002 to pending approval with those details."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ugh, seriously? It's literally approved already. Victor was the one who knew about the project, so I figured that was enough. Fine, I'll ping Tessa now. Can you make sure APR-4001 is definitely the one she sees, and let me know if she doesn't get to it before Friday?"
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "check_approval_status",
   "args": {
    "approval_id": "APR-4001"
   },
   "result": {
    "approval_id": "APR-4001",
    "type": "access",
    "subject_employee_id": "E2201",
