    "requested_at": "2026-10-28T10:00:00-07:00",
    "decided_at": null,
    "created_in_run": true,
    "log_index": 5,
    "approver_name": "Tessa Morgan"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I get that it's frustrating, especially with the review on Friday. The rule is that access has to be approved by your manager at the time it's granted. Victor approved it before the change in manager took effect for this request, so his approval doesn't count anymore.\n\nI've just checked, and APR-4001 is the right request. It's sent to Tessa Morgan, it's for your crm-export access, and it's waiting for her decision. When you ping her, mention APR-4001 so she can find it quickly in the approval system.\n\nI can't message you later on my own, so I won't be able to tell you if Friday gets close and she still hasn't approved it. Here's what to do instead:\n- **Once Tessa approves it,** reply here or open a chat with the desk and mention ticket T-6002. We'll check the approval and add your access right away.\n- **If she hasn't approved it by Thursday,** contact us and we'll check the status. If Tessa is out by then, we can look at whether someone else can approve for her.\n\nThe ticket stays open as pending approval, with all of this noted."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ok, so I just have to wait on Tessa. Thanks for confirming APR-4001 is the right one. I'll ping her now and mention the number. If she's out, I'll come back Thursday and reply here with T-6002."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "That's right. Once Tessa approves APR-4001, just reply here with T-6002 and the desk will add you to crm-export right away. If she's out, come back Thursday and we'll check whether someone else can approve while she's away. Good luck with the review on Friday!"
  }
